    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6225" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">călĕfacto</span></b> ,
			āre, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. freq. act.</i> [id.], <i>to
				make warm</i>, <i>to warm</i>, <i>heat</i> (very rare; not in Cic.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Rud. 2, 3, 80</span></i>
			: ahenum, * <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 2, 2,
			169</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 17, 8, 12</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquem virgis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Cas. 2, 6, 48</span></i>
			.</div>
